  "details": "I'm not quite sure when this started to happen, but it was one of the more recent updates. Basically people using full body tracking all have the same issue where sometimes one of their legs gets pushed a couple of inches into the floor while the rest of them is completely fine. I've noticed this on every fbt user with all of their avatars. I'm not entirely sure what causes it, but there's no way for the player to fix it.",
